WEBVTT

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:34.740
But why do we have to come along too?

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:37.280
After all, we voluntarily came with you

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:38.980
and we haven't violated any law.

00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:41.260
That blonde over there...

00:01:41.260 --> 00:01:43.360
Audrey-san, was it?

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:48.460
Didn't you launch some sort of mental attack on me?

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:51.730
T-T-T-That's...

00:01:51.730 --> 00:01:55.880
She has a curse of sorts placed upon her where
anyone who looks at her becomes like this.

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:57.650
A type of charm?

00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:58.790
No wonder...

00:01:59.120 --> 00:02:01.590
Mental attacks don't work on me

00:02:01.590 --> 00:02:03.640
because I've been trained for it.

00:02:03.860 --> 00:02:05.490
Despite that,

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:09.880
I can feel my impression of you
have been amplified by many times.

00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:13.110
Do you want a candy?

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:14.770
You're giving it to me? Yeah!

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:16.000
Aren't you affected?

00:02:17.510 --> 00:02:18.800
It may be indiscriminate

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:21.980
but I cannot let you off for mentally attacking me.

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:23.770
If you help out this time,

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:26.560
(That)
you'll be considered innocent along with that,

00:02:26.740 --> 00:02:29.190
so just think of this as a favor.

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:30.760
You're strong, right?

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:33.230
(This)
You were about to confront this after all.

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:36.050
You've been calling me "that" and "this" since a while ago.

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:37.590
Can't you call me by my name?

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.980
Your name is too long.

00:02:40.210 --> 00:02:41.590
Let's give you a nickname!

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:43.380
How about Schwa-kun?

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:47.220
We've just met and she wants to call me by a nickname?

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:49.200
Maybe she likes me?

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:52.860
Leaving that boooooring thing aside,

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:54.640
It's not boring!

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:57.820
I'll explain the outline for this quest again.

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:00.880
Recently, there have been reports

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:05.040
of robberies along the route up ahead
committed by a Living Armor.

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:07.190
A team have been dispatched to defeat it but...

00:03:07.650 --> 00:03:11.120
They were found stripped of all their possessions.

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:12.960
Stripped of all their possessions?

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:16.040
Each and every one of them were naked.

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:19.710
Suddenly, I have a bad feeling about this.

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:22.570
That said, there hasn't been any casualty.

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:24.670
So I believe the risk is low.

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:39.860
(Episode 5  An Ordinary Guy Who Reincarnated
Into A Total Fantasy Knockout And The Moving Armor)

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:44.170
Schwa-kun!

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:45.790
Is that our target?

00:03:45.940 --> 00:03:46.840
Most probably.

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:49.380
Magical power...

00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:51.460
The scent of strong magical power...

00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:53.220
Leave it here...

00:03:53.220 --> 00:03:54.210
- It's big...
- Leave it here...

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:54.720
Alright!

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:56.700
So this is where I come in, right?

00:03:58.840 --> 00:03:59.650
Wait.

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:03.070
Do you intend to use that sword in a place like this?

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:12.000
I believe this entire forest is going to be stripped bare.

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:16.480
If there is someone here to pick wild plants,
they'd be cleaved into two...

00:04:18.340 --> 00:04:20.280
Father-in-law, I understand now.

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:24.690
You think that I'm still not worthy for being
deluded by the peak power of the sword.

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:30.520
You want me to prove my worth
using a man's strength, is that right?!

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:31.860
Absolutely not.

00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:36.580
I've been fighting with the sword in its scabbard.

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:38.490
Let's do this, Gram!

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:47.620
How fast!

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:51.430
His movements are comparable to
those of our country's knights.

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:52.230
However...

00:04:57.550 --> 00:04:58.360
Get back!

00:04:58.360 --> 00:04:59.540
It's coming for you!!

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:11.790
Well...

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:13.770
W-Wait...

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:20.580
This isn't too bad...

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:23.650
My Gram!!!

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:26.530
Living Armor is powered by magic.

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:29.080
So it was after the sword's magical power.

00:05:30.040 --> 00:05:31.700
But it speaks fluently...?

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:34.930
It is supposed to be a magical weapon
that moves automatically.

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:38.940
I've never heard of a mechanism
that allows a human to go inside.

00:05:39.570 --> 00:05:40.870
Just what is it...?

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:46.670
Oh no!

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:48.150
Audrey-san, run!

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:50.690
It's coming after your tiara!

00:05:57.780 --> 00:05:59.450
Thank you, Jinguji.

00:05:59.640 --> 00:06:00.180
No problem.

00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:04.600
It's a pity that I won't be able to walk
around the town anymore.

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:05.650
I have no choice but to throw--

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:10.240
Hey, interrogator.

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:13.250
Can you tell me your annual income?

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:18.700
Annual income?

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:21.360
Yeah, it's very important.

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:22.480
Is that

00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:24.310
- necessary right now?
- Please tell us!

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:32.240
My annual salary is 100 gold coins.

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:33.900
Why is that important?

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:36.740
Do you get it now, Audrey?

00:06:37.720 --> 00:06:40.110
In other words, that thing on your head is...

00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:44.760
worth three years of a civil servant's salary!

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:50.450
Three years' worth of salary?!

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:54.640
That reverberated very intensely for a working adult.

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:56.720
Do your best and defeat it!

00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:00.770
What a negative way to raise morale...

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:03.850
Tch, I missed.

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:06.410
Chance!

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:10.820
How's that?

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:13.820
I've put in enough power to lightly pierce through steel.

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:16.410
Not even a Living Armor can come out of it unscathed...

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:22.210
Bro!!

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:26.820
This exterior

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:29.970
is made of magical steel that was produced
using an ancient method.

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:34.390
It can absorb external magical powers, reflect them

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:36.730
and is even equipped with an automatic recovery system.

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:37.620
That's impossible!

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:38.870
Are you saying you're an ancient weapon?

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:40.280
That's right.

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:41.730
Fear me,

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:42.980
human child.

00:07:44.280 --> 00:07:46.570
I am known as the Mighty Arm Vizd!

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:49.080
One of the Demon King's generals!

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:52.030
(Mighty Arm Vizd)

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:54.140
Demon King's general...

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:55.960
Mighty Arm...

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:57.660
Vizd...

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:01.440
What's going on...

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:02.740
No way...

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:05.120
It can't be... that's...

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:09.890
That fear too

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:11.540
- It can't be!
- is my

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:14.090
- sustenance.
- Bro, you're actually a girl!

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:18.020
I've always thought you were a guy, sorry.

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:19.070
No...

00:08:19.070 --> 00:08:21.890
Well, I was acting as one, so...

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:25.810
Put this on for now.

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:27.890
Thank you very much.

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:29.580
Everyone, withdraw!

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:31.520
I'll be the bait.

00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:32.370
But...

00:08:32.680 --> 00:08:33.540
It's fine.

00:08:33.730 --> 00:08:36.240
It is probably just storing up magical power.

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:38.030
At best, I'll just end up naked.

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:40.090
That's not okay at all!

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:43.060
Hey, can't you do something about this, Jinguji?

00:08:43.060 --> 00:08:45.320
At this rate, the interrogator is going to become naked!

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:49.530
Marry... Marry...

00:08:49.530 --> 00:08:51.330
Ma...rry...

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:54.080
Please marry me, Audrey-san!

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:55.690
What are you two doing?!

00:08:55.690 --> 00:08:57.990
I will save the world for your sake!

00:08:57.990 --> 00:08:59.040
As for children...

00:08:59.040 --> 00:08:59.590
No...

00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:02.030
- It's too early for that.
- Somehow, is everyone

00:09:02.030 --> 00:09:04.650
- I want to build a warm family!
- cursed to complain like that?

00:09:04.930 --> 00:09:07.090
Forget it, just put this on!

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:08.690
Sit down over there!

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:10.260
I can't bear it anymore...

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:12.600
My head is about to go crazy.

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:14.740
Geez...

00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:17.490
There, is this okay?

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:20.240
I'm all the way at the edge.

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:21.720
You can't even see my body, right?!

00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:23.990
So, just do your best from here on out.

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:28.210
He wore it like I told him to but...

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:30.400
With Tachibana like this...

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:31.860
How should I say this?

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:34.160
It's like I can't calm down...

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:36.390
Like I'm feeling all fluffy...

00:09:36.850 --> 00:09:38.250
Just what is this feeling?!

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:39.810
(Charmed)

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:41.250
I wore clothes, didn't I?!

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:42.650
Why did it get worse?

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:44.440
I don't get it. Why?

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:48.640
Watanabe-san...

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:51.880
I... get it...

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:52.960
Schwa-kun?

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:55.500
How dare you ignore me?

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:56.660
Sorry, Armor-kun!

00:09:56.660 --> 00:09:57.490
Wait there!

00:09:57.710 --> 00:09:59.060
You are now

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:01.120
being deeply impressed by

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:03.490
what they call the "boyfriend shirt"!

00:10:05.050 --> 00:10:07.130
The boyfriend shirt?!

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:08.700
(Home  June  Second Week)
The boyfriend shirt is...

00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:10.840
(Akari  I'm surprised it rained heavily so suddenly.)
that rare appearance

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:12.380
(My clothes are all wet...)
which might only be seen

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:13.380
(Hinata  It's fine to stay here until the rain lets up.)
when the girlfriend does not

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:15.320
(I'll put the clothes in the dryer, so put this on.)
have any other pajamas

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:17.720
(Akari  Thank you, Senpai.)
when she comes to the boyfriend's house to stay for the night.

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:19.820
(Then I'll maybe accept it...)
Because it is oversized,

00:10:19.820 --> 00:10:22.540
it looks like she isn't wearing anything underneath.

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:23.620
An absolute killer.

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:27.760
And the fact that she is enveloped by your scent is

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:28.950
(Akari  Senpai's shirt... is really big...)
the best part.

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:32.690
(Somehow it's making me nervous...)
It is one the top three secret dreams of a virgin.

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:35.680
Jinguji.

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:38.300
I didn't think you'd have such a pure taste.

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:41.210
That's something only a high school student
would get excited about.

00:10:41.210 --> 00:10:43.810
Don't go making up my fetish on your own!

00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:46.610
But the result has been committed, you know...

00:10:47.490 --> 00:10:49.420
(Charmed)
This is annoying!

00:10:49.690 --> 00:10:51.150
How dare you take me for a fool!

00:10:51.470 --> 00:10:54.160
If you desired be hunted down...

00:10:54.910 --> 00:10:57.020
then I shall grant your wish!

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:01.170
Things like boyfriend shirt

00:11:01.810 --> 00:11:03.680
is something that...

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:05.470
I have no interest in!

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:14.790
If you think I'm a man who can get excited
about something like that,

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:16.020
then I'm really disappointed in you!

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:17.650
Correct it, Tachibana!

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:18.350
Wait!

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:20.330
Jinguji, behind you!

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:22.050
Don't dodge the issue!

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:24.850
It feels really sick to have you think that I'm a man

00:11:24.850 --> 00:11:26.180
with such childish taste!

00:11:26.570 --> 00:11:29.220
Hey, are you really...

00:11:29.220 --> 00:11:30.000
okay?

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:31.360
To begin with!

00:11:31.570 --> 00:11:34.240
Compared to you who likes bunny girls or maids

00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:36.970
I think my taste is rather decent!

00:11:37.810 --> 00:11:38.970
Huuuhhh...

00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:41.620
So you'll deny other people's tastes, huh...

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:44.930
Hey, stop moving!

00:11:45.670 --> 00:11:48.160
Since you've said so, Jinguji,

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:50.450
why don't you imagine me in it?

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:51.380
In what?

00:11:51.910 --> 00:11:53.240
What else?

00:11:53.240 --> 00:11:54.980
In a bunny outfit, as a bunny girl.

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:56.170
Bunny...

00:12:03.020 --> 00:12:04.080
I've got you!

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:06.340
It won't work!

00:12:06.340 --> 00:12:07.540
What about a bunny outfit?!

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:10.340
Did you think I'd fall for such a simple trick?!

00:12:10.510 --> 00:12:11.840
Simple?!

00:12:12.390 --> 00:12:14.320
Then what about a maid's outfit?

00:12:14.930 --> 00:12:15.920
Maid outfit...

00:12:16.370 --> 00:12:18.970
Imagine me in the long-type dress that you like!

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:22.390
If my long-ranged attacks and axe don't work on you...

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:25.410
Magic absorption...

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:27.100
Transfer into the booster!

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:31.460
Joint and muscle strength enhancement!

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:35.330
Full Spec Mode!

00:12:41.410 --> 00:12:43.490
I will blast this entire area away!

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:46.320
Long-type maid dress...

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:49.830
Long-type maid dress...
Welcome home, Master.

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:51.360
That...

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:56.580
won't work!!

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:06.400
Oh, crap...

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:15.930
Wha... What...

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:19.510
What's that about "Welcome home, Master"?

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:23.250
How dare you carelessly call a stranger
you've never met as "Master"?!

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:24.100
Shut up!

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:26.150
You're always looking down on others!

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:27.730
That's a bad habit, you know!

00:13:27.730 --> 00:13:29.140
This isn't about it being a bad habit!

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:30.200
- What was that?
- It's a fact! A fact!

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:32.250
- There's no way that's right!
- It's your fault for behaving in ways that others frown upon!

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:33.580
Hey! You're being nosy!

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:34.340
What?

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:42.130
A girl?

00:13:43.970 --> 00:13:44.610
(Life With An Ordinary Guy Who Reincarnated
Into A Total Fantasy Knockout)

00:13:44.610 --> 00:13:46.230
Love, love, cute!

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:54.930
I thought the King of Demons was just a fairy tale.

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:59.570
So if you abruptly brought in a general
- of the Demon King's army... - Let me go! Hey! Let me go!

00:13:59.570 --> 00:14:02.840
I find it hard to believe it myself.

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:05.780
Don't get ahead of yourself, humans!

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:09.530
Trash like you will get beaten up by my allies
who will come rescue me,

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:10.510
you're all doomed!

00:14:11.650 --> 00:14:15.510
For all that big talk, you still need someone
to come rescue you.

00:14:16.050 --> 00:14:18.130
Do you still have allies around?

00:14:18.130 --> 00:14:19.970
How many are there exactly?

00:14:24.720 --> 00:14:26.500
Aren't you a feisty one?

00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:28.150
The Mighty Arm Vizd.

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:32.820
It felt like a shock... a shock...

00:14:33.370 --> 00:14:35.200
I still hold a grudge on you

00:14:35.440 --> 00:14:37.510
for tearing my clothes apart.

00:14:37.510 --> 00:14:39.630
This person is pretty scary.

00:14:39.780 --> 00:14:41.250
She's an interrogator after all.

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:43.160
Damn it.

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:46.820
If only I wasn't in this situation, I would've...

00:14:48.470 --> 00:14:49.310
She's crying.

00:14:49.630 --> 00:14:51.360
Serves her right.

00:14:51.650 --> 00:14:52.590
Hey, you.

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:54.450
Where is this Demon King?

00:14:55.010 --> 00:14:57.290
If you're his general, you should at least
know where he is, right?

00:14:57.940 --> 00:14:58.890
You're asking where he is?

00:14:59.060 --> 00:15:00.600
The Demon King is...

00:15:01.860 --> 00:15:03.090
I see.

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:05.610
You lot haven't realized it yet, have you?

00:15:05.910 --> 00:15:08.340
Now that's just convenient.

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:12.430
I should gather more magical power before the hero appears.

00:15:13.840 --> 00:15:17.470
If you believe that the hero hasn't appeared
in this world yet,

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:19.520
then you're wrong, Vizd.

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:20.780
What?

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:22.260
That's because....

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:23.500
I...

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:27.440
Schwartz von Liechtenstein Lohengramm

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:30.220
am the summoned hero!

00:15:30.690 --> 00:15:31.450
What?

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:34.610
There's no way someone as plain as you be the hero.

00:15:34.840 --> 00:15:37.380
Why does no one believe me?!

00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:39.010
It's fine because it's a lie

00:15:39.010 --> 00:15:42.480
but telling such information to an enemy
is the last thing you should do.

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:44.420
Even my ally thinks like this!

00:15:44.810 --> 00:15:47.490
You're all so noisy, so please get out!

00:15:47.490 --> 00:15:49.270
You're getting in the way of my work.

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:52.420
Stop!

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:58.320
Just what is going on in there?

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:06.430
Damn it.

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:08.660
I got tortured so badly...

00:16:09.260 --> 00:16:12.300
Even the core of my body is still reeling from the shock...

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:15.730
Not even one hit...

00:16:17.300 --> 00:16:19.320
I didn't even manage to land one hit.

00:16:19.710 --> 00:16:23.370
Even though I still need to gather magical power...

00:16:23.740 --> 00:16:25.030
But now I'm in this mess.

00:16:26.440 --> 00:16:28.420
Dear me, you're right.

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:31.510
You're so pathetic.

00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:33.840
Weakest weakling, Vizd-chan.

00:16:34.460 --> 00:16:35.560
Calm...

00:16:39.960 --> 00:16:43.520
I'm sure the Demon King would be lamenting your failure.

00:16:44.370 --> 00:16:45.750
There's no way that's true!

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:48.550
I'm sure he would be praising me for trying hard!

00:16:48.810 --> 00:16:51.200
And I even got my hands on some information!

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:54.120
The hero is already in this world!

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:56.610
Oh, I heard that while I was hiding.

00:16:56.610 --> 00:16:59.100
I'm sure that boy is a fake.

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:00.310
He looks more like a mob.

00:17:00.880 --> 00:17:02.080
You!

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:05.920
If you were watching then you should've saved me earlier.

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:07.720
That four-eyes...

00:17:07.720 --> 00:17:09.410
When my magical power recovers,

00:17:09.410 --> 00:17:13.140
I'll definitely avenge the armor.

00:17:14.190 --> 00:17:16.870
Oh, that four-eyes did that.

00:17:20.840 --> 00:17:23.290
I guess I kinda self-destruct this time!

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:26.940
But the next time we fight, it'll definitely be my win! 100%!

00:17:27.180 --> 00:17:28.240
Sure, sure.

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:29.870
Don't get excited near my ear.

00:17:29.870 --> 00:17:32.150
I'm not excited at all!

00:17:35.090 --> 00:17:38.180
Good morning, Audrey-san!

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:40.610
Could you still be in your pajamas?

00:17:40.610 --> 00:17:45.200
Well, I won't hide the fact that
it's also one of my objectives!

00:17:45.200 --> 00:17:47.540
I heard that you're still in your room

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:49.460
so I was thinking of having breakfast

00:17:51.410 --> 00:17:53.560
to...gether...

00:17:53.560 --> 00:17:54.630
but...

00:17:54.980 --> 00:17:56.000
Morning.

00:17:56.480 --> 00:17:59.210
Oh, good morning, Father-in-law.

00:18:04.150 --> 00:18:05.660
Where is there a...

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:06.570
Door?

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:10.550
Who is it?

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:12.690
Oh, it's me, Schwartz.

00:18:13.420 --> 00:18:15.960
I'm busy right now, just come on in.

00:18:19.480 --> 00:18:20.340
A house?!

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:24.600
This is the skill I got from that shitty goddess.

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:25.580
This?

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:27.020
That means...

00:18:27.020 --> 00:18:29.100
This is Watanabe-san's home?

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:30.950
I thought he'd be

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:34.300
living in a house dyed in darkness.

00:18:34.540 --> 00:18:36.000
It's kinda dull.

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:38.370
I'm sorry it's dull.

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:40.920
This is Audrey-san's house?

00:18:41.190 --> 00:18:42.420
Yup, my home.

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:46.900
There are lots of stuff in here
that seems like they belong to a guy...

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:49.360
Schwa-kun,

00:18:49.930 --> 00:18:51.510
what I'm about to tell you

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:54.640
is a very painful fact.

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:00.980
Good morning.

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:04.510
Oh, did you get a good night's sleep?

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:07.140
Yes, thank you very much.

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:09.140
My first love...

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:11.580
That was my first love...

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:13.970
Hinata Tachibana...

00:19:14.660 --> 00:19:16.830
32 years old, an office worker...

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:18.070
A man...

00:19:18.830 --> 00:19:21.820
To rob a young man of his first love,

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:24.760
I'm such a sinful woman...

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:27.080
Say, how old are you, Schwa-kun?

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:29.020
Is it written in your status?

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:31.250
I'm in my third year of high school.

00:19:31.450 --> 00:19:33.570
What's that about status?

00:19:34.340 --> 00:19:35.620
So she escaped.

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:37.200
I'm ashamed of this.

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:40.850
Well, there's nothing much we can do
if this is how she escapes.

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:43.400
So we didn't get anything on the Demon King.

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:46.900
If she could do something like this, she would've done so
during the interrogation.

00:19:47.170 --> 00:19:49.680
I suppose it's safe to assume that her allies
came to her rescue.

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:51.650
I thought we'd be able to get

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:54.150
more information if we get to a bigger town.

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:56.100
The only thing I know

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:58.330
is that we don't know anything at all.

00:19:59.190 --> 00:19:59.990
To begin with,

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:03.620
the idea of the Demon King is only passed down in folklore.

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:06.870
I guess we should go to a bigger town to look into it.

00:20:07.490 --> 00:20:08.430
Hey, Tachibana.

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:09.770
(Tachibana  Hero  Gender: Female  Level: 2 Strengths  Power: 1)
I didn't know

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:11.180
(Agility:1  Intelligence: 30  Luck: 83)
there's such a convenient feature.

00:20:11.570 --> 00:20:14.490
It's really convenient when you want
to gauge the enemy's abilities.

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:17.200
Tachibana-san, you're so weak.

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:18.690
That's right.

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:20.860
My only strong point is my cuteness.

00:20:21.090 --> 00:20:21.920
So protect me.

00:20:22.310 --> 00:20:25.670
He's really good at getting along with others, as always.

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:26.840
No, ugh...

00:20:26.840 --> 00:20:29.140
He doesn't build any mental walls around himself.

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:31.590
That's a lifestyle I'm not capable of.

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:35.250
He's always surrounded by people.

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:36.850
And...

00:20:47.840 --> 00:20:50.860
Jinguji is so fast we couldn't catch him!

00:20:51.130 --> 00:20:52.950
Let's leave him out of our games!

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:58.170
That brings back a bad memory.

00:20:58.320 --> 00:20:59.800
Hey, Jinguji.

00:20:59.930 --> 00:21:02.100
Schwa-kun said it's fine to look at his status.

00:21:02.250 --> 00:21:03.990
(Hero  Gender: Male  Level: 22)

00:21:04.260 --> 00:21:06.210
Why are you hiding your name?

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:09.290
Well, it's just physically impossible to...

00:21:09.630 --> 00:21:11.440
What do you even mean by that?

00:21:11.440 --> 00:21:13.630
In any case, my name is

00:21:13.630 --> 00:21:16.730
Schwartz von Liechtenstein Lohengramm.

00:21:16.730 --> 00:21:17.680
Okay?

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:21.390
Well, I'm not that concerned about it so it's fine...

00:21:21.390 --> 00:21:23.440
(Hero  Gender: Male  Level: 22)
Schwa-kun,

00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:25.140
your level is pretty average.

00:21:25.390 --> 00:21:28.210
It's Jinguji-san whose level is too high.

00:21:28.210 --> 00:21:29.100
Don't feel down!

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:30.720
The most important thing is the skill.

00:21:30.880 --> 00:21:34.700
(Strengths  Power: 20  Agility: 32  Intelligence: 28  Luck: 5)
Check out this ample list of skills!

00:21:34.700 --> 00:21:36.450
(Skills  Passive  Active  Blessing of the Goddess of Night MAX)
It's really long.

00:21:36.450 --> 00:21:38.890
(Demon Rule LV3  Blood Pain  False Mask EX  Table Tennis LV 1)
And you're with the table tennis club, huh?

00:21:38.890 --> 00:21:41.160
(Survival LV 1)
Is that information in there too?

00:21:41.370 --> 00:21:43.730
Is there a skill you don't know yourself?

00:21:43.960 --> 00:21:46.080
I don't know most of them.

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:48.660
I can only say the naming sense is pretty good.

00:21:49.330 --> 00:21:51.440
We can try it out at a place
where there isn't anyone around.

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:52.800
Yeah.

00:21:53.060 --> 00:21:54.910
What do you think Schwa-kun?

00:22:00.560 --> 00:22:04.280
What skill did you use?!

00:23:35.770 --> 00:23:37.980
Now, let's get down to business,

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:39.220
Mighty Arm Vizd.

00:23:39.750 --> 00:23:42.260
Do you think I'd give into pain?

00:23:42.260 --> 00:23:44.090
Huh? What? What's is that fluffy thing...

00:23:44.090 --> 00:23:45.390
(Episode 6  An Ordinary Guy Who Reincarnated
Into A Total Fantasy Knockout And The Free Spirit)

00:23:45.390 --> 00:23:46.120
Wait, wait!

00:23:46.580 --> 00:23:49.060
- You sure cry in a very sweet voice!
- Not there! Not there!

00:23:49.060 --> 00:23:49.510
No, I can't!
